# Single-page app fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
# Real files (assets, sitemap.xml, feed.xml, llms.txt, robots.txt) are served
# normally; any other path is handed to the router.
#
# The legacy-domain 301 (`shekargah.mmehdi.ir` → `shekargaah.ir`) lives in
# `functions/_middleware.ts`: Cloudflare Pages only matches paths in this file,
# never hostnames, so a host-scoped rule here would be silently ignored.
/*    /index.html    200